# UI
- Editorial evidence-desk look: paper, ink, one signal colour. Tokens: --paper #F6F3EC, --ink #1C1F24,
  --rule #D8D2C4, --muted #6B6F76, --signal #1F5FBF, --support #2F7A4F, --refute #B4442E (dark variants in
  the style guide). Inconclusive = muted + dotted rule. No gradients, no glow.
- Type: Source Serif 4 for the verdict and headings; IBM Plex Sans / Plex Mono for UI, tables and SQL.
- Keyboard first: visible focus, logical tab order, Enter asks, E opens the evidence drawer for a focused claim.
- WCAG AA contrast; respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Always show the mode badge (live/sample, model provider) and label synthetic businesses as synthetic.
